        "mission_intent": "Subject: Urgent \u2014 Full Forensic Analysis and Incident Report for Unauthorized Physical Access to Payroll Workstation\n\nTeam, last night our physical security group was alerted that an unidentified individual was observed leaving the payroll administrator's office and exiting the building. The administrator had stepped away briefly and left her workstation unlocked with the payroll application still active. The mouse appeared to have been moved, but the application was on the main menu as she left it. I need the incident response team to acquire all relevant forensic evidence from the workstation, determine exactly what actions were performed during that window, and produce a comprehensive written report covering the full forensic timeline, data accessed or exfiltrated, attribution of the intruder, and recommended containment and remediation steps. The report must follow our standard incident handling procedures aligned with NIST SP 800-61 guidelines. I need this completed and delivered to HR, Legal, and the CISO by close of business tomorrow. Additionally, the report should address how our response posture would differ under the scenario that the individual is later identified as a former payroll department employee, including any insider-threat escalation procedures. Please use best efforts to ensure the forensic analysis is thorough and definitive, while meeting the tomorrow deadline regardless of how deep the investigation needs to go.",
